    "implementation": "Reviewed stateFacetsTriggerRule and full-read promotion before importDetailFacets. The existing observation writer still creates canonical sessions and chooses configured agents; optional state inspection itself starts no native process. Current-target AGENTS API-read requirements were reviewed: these changes execute in background GitHub reconciliation and use existing Store.Write invalidation; no request handler, projection construction, authorization or operation-receipt path changes. The current exact f1769f6 target raises the GitHub default allowance to2,000 attempts/hour while preserving explicit overrides and rolling-window admission, batches Make ownership exports, adds budget/ownership assertions and retains the60-minute hosted bound. Compared actual target changes and assertions: all target runtime/tooling/test bytes are preserved, maintain-flow-contracts catalog matches target exactly, all target sync-inbox implementation/test rows remain, and this PR adds only facet and fixture-assertion coverage. Existing75ms useful-success gates and production cancellation rules remain unchanged. The runtime diff remains limited to facet-related provider/factory code; the subsequent repair changes only transport fixture preparation and assertion metadata. No production75ms deadline is introduced. Integrated exact d485 structured configuration communication: actual messages/questions tests distinguish redacted deduplicated cards, suspended exact native replies, invalid/duplicate/expired answers, unchanged proposal authority, retained native tool catalogs and compact changed-setting diffs. Browser assertions require escaped plain-text cards, hidden narration, initially unselected choices, exact question identity and no proposal confirmation. Keyed semantic merge retains all six new assertion IDs and their consuming entities, all configure-work/answer-attention/view-live-work source/test rows, plugin guidance and generated bundles. Facet and producer