    "tests": "Read TestConcurrentFirstEventsOneCanonicalSession asserting one session and twenty pending observations after concurrent events. TestRoutineStateRuleRefreshesHistoryBeforeQueuingWork now proves a CI rule receives current discussion and one queued event after the full-history promotion. The transport fixture preparation change is verification-only: the large saved-source paging/search fixture now starts through the real HTTP pending response and waits for its exact projection key and current revision before the original functional call. Its original five-second call guard, all page/body/search/delivery assertions, and every separate 75ms successful-response gate remain intact. The blocked-producer regression rejects a different ready key and stale revision; a skip-producer mutation fails. Identical one-CPU/five-busy-process control fails the reviewed test at factory_test.go:236 and passes the repaired fixture with all assertions."
